"Continue as a Guest» vil ikke være tilgjengelig for deltakere i dette "
"arrangementet."

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1261
msgid "Show availability in event overviews"
msgstr "Vis tilgjengelighet i arrangementsoversikter"

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1263
msgid ""
"If checked, the list of events will show if events are sold out. This might "
"make for longer page loading times if you have lots of events and the shown "
"status might be out of date for up to two minutes."
msgstr ""
"Hvis dette er valgt, viser arrangementslisten om arrangementer er utsolgt. "
"Dette kan gi lengre sidelastingstid hvis det finnes mange arrangementer, og "
"statusen som vises kan være opptil to minutter utdatert."

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1277
#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1285
#: eventyay/orga/forms/event.py:33
#: eventyay/presale/templates/pretixpresale/organizers/base.html:124
msgid "List"
msgstr "Liste"

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1278
#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1286
msgid "Week calendar"
msgstr "Ukalender"

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1279
#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1287
