"arrangementsdatoer, brukes den tidligste datoen."

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1362
#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1383
msgid ""
"Only allow changes if the resulting price is higher or equal than the "
"previous price."
msgstr ""
"Tillat bare endringer hvis den resulterende prisen er høyere enn eller lik "
"den forrige prisen."

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1366
#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1387
msgid ""
"Only allow changes if the resulting price is higher than the previous price."
msgstr ""
"Tillat bare endringer hvis den resulterende prisen er høyere enn den forrige "
"prisen."

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1370
#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1391
msgid ""
"Only allow changes if the resulting price is equal to the previous price."
msgstr ""
"Tillat bare endringer hvis den resulterende prisen er lik den forrige prisen."

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1374
#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1395
msgid "Allow changes regardless of price, even if this results in a refund."
msgstr "Tillat endringer uavhengig av pris, selv om dette medfører en refusjon."

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1379
msgid "Requirement for changed prices"
msgstr "Krav til endrede priser"

#: eventyay/base/configurations/default_setting.py:1407
msgid "Do not allow changes after"
